        <h3 class="section-title">Occupational Taxes</h3>
        <div class="content-body">
          <p>You can deduct an occupational tax charged at a flat rate by a locality for the privilege of working or conducting a business in the locality. If you are an employee, you can claim this deduction as an adjustment to income. If you are self-employed, you can claim this deduction as a deduction for taxes elsewhere on your return.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="column">
        <h3 class="section-title">Travel expenses may include:</h3>
        <div class="content-body">
          <ul>
            <li><span data-field="travel_expense">{{ travel_expense }}</span>.</li>
            <li><span data-field="travel_expense">{{ travel_expense }}</span>.</li>
            <li><span data-field="travel_expense">{{ travel_expense }}</span>.</li>
            <li><span data-field="travel_expense">{{ travel_expense }}</span>.</li>
            <li><span data-field="travel_expense">{{ travel_expense }}</span>.</li>
          </ul>
          <p>Travel expenses are discussed more fully in chapter 1 of Publication 463.</p>
        </div>
        <h3 class="section-title">Temporary work assignment.</h3>
        <div class="content-body">
          <p>If your assignment or job away from home in a single location is realistically expected to last for 1 year or less, it is temporary. If your assignment or job away from home in a single location is realistically expected to last for 1 year or more, it is indefinite.</p>
          <p>If your assignment or job away from home in a single location is realistically expected to last for 1 year or less, it is temporary. If your assignment or job away from home in a single location is realistically expected to last for 1 year or more, it is indefinite.</p>
          <p>If your assignment or job away from home in a single location is realistically expected to last for 1 year or less, it is temporary. If your assignment or job away from home in a single location is realistically expected to last for 1 year or more, it is indefinite.</p>
        </div>
