      <div class="column">
        <h3 class="section-title">Research Expenses of a College Professor</h3>
        <div class="content-body">
          <p>You can deduct expenses for research, teaching, lecturing, or writing and publishing on subjects that relate to your field of study. You must have undertaken research or writing or publishing on a subject that relates to your field of study. You must have undertaken research or writing or publishing on a subject that relates to your field of study.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="column">
        <h3 class="section-title">Union Dues and Expenses</h3>
        <div class="content-body">
          <p>You can deduct dues and union expenses paid for benefits to union members.</p>
          <p>You can also deduct assessments for benefit payments made to a union. You can deduct expenses for union meetings, conventions, and other activities. See Lobbying Expenses under Nondeductible Expenses.</p>
        </div>
        <h3 class="section-title">Work Clothes and Uniforms</h3>
        <div class="content-body">
          <p>You can deduct the cost and upkeep of work clothes if the following two requirements are met:</p>
          <ul>
            <li><span data-field="work_clothes_condition">{{ work_clothes_condition }}</span>.</li>
            <li><span data-field="work_clothes_condition">{{ work_clothes_condition }}</span>.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
