      <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 10px;">Products you can walk in to many post offices, libraries, and IRS offices to pick up certain forms, instructions, and publications. Some IRS offices, li-braries, grocery stores, copy centers, city and county offices, and other places have a collection of IRS products available.</p>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 10px;">Also, some IRS offices and libraries have the Inter-net. You can use the Internet to access IRS publications, Bulletins, and Circulars. Available by re-search.</p>
