      <h3 style="font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 10px;">Asking tax questions.</h3>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Call the IRS with your tax questions. You can get help from IRS representatives who can answer your questions. You can also get help from Taxpayer Assistance Center for an appointment. To schedule an appointment, call 1-800-829-1040.</p>
